      "content": "What I understood you are asking for:\n1. \"I'd like to find groups of patients whose mutations hit similar pathways, testing between 3 and 5 groups.\" -- the request does not say whether one item may belong to several groups at once: if one group each: SAMBAR; if several groups at once: no registered workflow gives this.\n2. \"What I'm after is grouping the 60 colorectal patients by which pathways their mutations hit, with three to five groups.\" -- the request does not say whether one item may belong to several groups at once: if one group each: SAMBAR; if several groups at once: no registered workflow gives this.\n\nBefore I choose a workflow, please tell me: Should each gene, regulator or sample belong to one group only (one group each), or may one belong to several groups at once?\n\nNo workflow has been selected and nothing runs before you answer.\n\nNo files were inspected and no analysis ran."
